# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, folder, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
# Groupe Alliance 0.7.0: the Uldaman chapter (ex 20b-uldaman, written for this pack by BurN-30,
# GPL-3.0; sources in its header: Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex, Wowhead Forever's
# zone and quest pages read on 08/11/2026, room order from the original game's comments) now runs
# here, after the Badlands quests, instead of before them: the Ironforge rewards are handed in on
# the flight to Southshore (Thelsamar, Ironforge, Southshore), one trip to Ironforge and back
# saved (about 7 minutes). Asked once in Ironforge at the end of the previous guide (`when group
# 2240`); every Uldaman step needs `when done uld-start`. Nothing in it depends on the Badlands
# quests or the other way round (Polestar's Forever data: no prerequisite between them; Uldaman's
# minimum levels 30 to 40, lower than the Badlands quests'). Not played in game.
# The two Dwarf and Gnome steps at the start (back from the riding trainer) now wait for a
# player who is not in the Badlands already (`when !zone`): one below 40 never left them.
guide groupe-alliance/21-terres-ingrates-hinterlands
title Group 19 · Badlands & The Hinterlands
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 43-43
zone Badlands
next groupe-alliance/22-feralas

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452).

step Fly to Thelsamar
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  when !zone "Badlands"
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Thelsamar"

step Badlands
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  when !zone "Badlands"
  zone Badlands
  goto 49.6,66.3 "Badlands"

step Agmond's End
  zone Badlands
  kill 2945 quest 739                 -- Murdaloc
  kill 2893 quest 739                 -- Stonevault Bonesnapper

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 1108 optional                -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1137 optional                         -- for Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats: the Tanaris guide crosses them at 45, keep it
  turnin 703                          -- Rigglefuzz
  turnin 705                          -- Blue Pearls from Stranglethorn
  note Rigglefuzz's next quest pays no experience: skip it.

step Uldaman (dungeon, optional): Rigglefuzz
  label uld-start
  when group 2240
  tip Uldaman: a 5-player dungeon at the north end of the Badlands, levels 35 to 47 (41 to 51 in the group finder): best at 43 or more. The Badlands quests come first, then the dungeon, then the rewards in Ironforge on the way to Southshore. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on in the Badlands.
  note Keep 5 free quest log slots. Everyone takes the quests at their own pace; meet at the entrance for the run.
  accept 2418 optional                    -- Rigglefuzz, Valley of Fangs

step Boss Tho'grun
  tip Ride west across the Badlands to the Dustbelcher camp at Camp Boff. Boss Tho'grun stands in its middle with Wyrmhunters and Maulers around him.
  collect 4640 quest 732              -- Sign of the Earth

step Garek
  tip Ride back east to Dustwind Gulch.
  turnin 732
  note Garek's next task is an elite hunt: skip it.

step Lethlor Ravine
  tip The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind.
  collect 4612 quest 706 optional     -- Black Drake's Heart

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: was "Hammertoe's Digsite". Once this guide's goals name Hammertoe Grez
# (Uldaman), forge reads "Hammertoe" in the place name as his first name (GUIDE_FORMAT, "Names in
# texts"), and Polestar's data has no area 346 to write the place as a token: the step is named
# after its NPC instead.
step Sigrun Ironhew
  turnin 706 optional                 -- Sigrun Ironhew

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Uldaman (optional)

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: the A Sign of Hope chain goes on outside Uldaman (Hammertoe Grez,
# Magregan Deepshadow, elite 38, Badlands 38.99,19.73 in Polestar's data), then with Ryedol on the
# way out and in Ironforge. An Ambassador of Evil (762, Angor Fortress, Badlands) and The Lost
# Tablets of Will (1139, inside Uldaman by Galgann Firehammer) come after the Ironforge visit:
# left out, the route does not come back.
step Uldaman: Hammertoe Grez
  when group 2240
  when done uld-start
  when onquest 721
  zone Badlands
  tip Hammertoe Grez waits just outside Uldaman, west of the cave. His amulet is on Magregan Deepshadow, a Shadowforge dwarf (elite 38) outside the dungeon portal, south of Hammertoe.
  turnin 721                                  -- Hammertoe Grez
  accept 722
  collect 4635 quest 722 @38.99,19.73         -- Hammertoe's Amulet: Magregan Deepshadow, elite 38
  turnin 722                                  -- Hammertoe Grez
  accept 723                                  -- For Prospector Ryedol, on the way out of the Badlands

step The digsite and the outer cave
  when done uld-start
  zone Badlands
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves of the digsite in front of the cave and of the outer cave drop both power stones, not often: no need to enter the instance for them. Krom's chest is in the outer cave, at the back of the left-hand hall, behind a pillar, with two guards.
  collect 8009 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- Dentrium Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8052 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- An'Alleum Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8027 quest 1360                 -- Krom Stoutarm's Treasure, from his chest
  goto 44.6,12.1 "Uldaman" r 25

step Baelog and the hidden chamber
  when done uld-start
  tip Baelog, Eric and Olaf wait in the first halls, at the top of a ramp. The chest beside Baelog holds the Gni'kiv Medallion, Revelosh drops the Shaft of Tsol: together they make the Staff of Prehistoria. Plant it in the Map Room, kill Ironaya (elite), then walk all the way into the chamber.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share. A Shattered Necklace may drop on the way: its chain goes on with Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.
  turnin 2398                             -- Baelog
  accept 2240
  complete 2240                           -- Explore the hidden chamber
  accept 2198 item 7666 optional          -- Shattered Necklace, a drop: for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): the Mage class quest of the codex (Power in Uldaman, 1956, from
# Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh after The Exorcism), only for Mages who hold it. Obsidian Power
# Source: Obsidian Sentinel (Polestar's Forever data, 100 %).
step Mages: Power in Uldaman
  only Mage
  when done uld-start
  when onquest 1956
  along until uld-archaedas
  tip The Obsidian Sentinel, one of the bosses on the way to Archaedas, drops the Obsidian Power Source for Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.
  collect 8053 quest 1956                 -- Obsidian Power Source: Obsidian Sentinel

step Archaedas and the Discs of Norgannon
  label uld-archaedas
  when done uld-start
  tip Archaedas, the last boss, wakes the stone guardians around his room during the fight. Behind him, the Discs of Norgannon: click them, talk to the spirit on the left, then click the Discs again for the miniature copy before you leave.
  accept 2278 object 131474 optional      -- The Discs of Norgannon
  turnin 2278 object 131474 optional
  accept 2279 object 131474 optional

step Rigglefuzz
  when onquest 2418
  zone Badlands
  tip Leave by the front, south to the Valley of Fangs.
  turnin 2418 optional                    -- Rigglefuzz

step Prospector Ryedol
  when onquest 723
  zone Badlands
  tip At the digsite by the road north to Loch Modan, on the way to the Thelsamar flight.
  turnin 723                                  -- Prospector Ryedol
  accept 724                                  -- For Historian Karnik in Ironforge

step Ironforge rewards
  when done uld-start
  zone Ironforge
  tip Fly from Thelsamar to Ironforge. Prospector Stormpike, Krom Stoutarm and High Explorer Magellas are all in the Hall of Explorers; Talvash del Kissel in the Mystic Ward.
  turnin 2240                             -- Prospector Stormpike
  turnin 1360                             -- Krom Stoutarm
  turnin 2279 optional                    -- High Explorer Magellas
  turnin 2198 optional                    -- Talvash del Kissel: his follow-ups need another Uldaman run, not in this guide

step Hall of Explorers: Historian Karnik and Advisor Belgrum
  when onquest 724
  zone Ironforge
  tip Both stand in the Hall of Explorers. Karnik's last task, An Ambassador of Evil, is in Angor Fortress in the Badlands, which the route has left: do not take it.
  turnin 724                                  -- Historian Karnik
  accept 725
  turnin 725                                  -- Advisor Belgrum
  accept 726
  turnin 726                                  -- Historian Karnik

step The Vault of Ironforge: the Platinum Discs reward
  when turnedin 2279
  zone Ironforge
  tip High Explorer Magellas hands a voucher for the Discs of Norgannon: Dinita Stonemantle pays it in the Vault of Ironforge.
  accept 2439                                 -- High Explorer Magellas
  turnin 2439                                 -- Dinita Stonemantle, in the Vault

step Fly to Southshore
  when done uld-start
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Southshore"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore and Aerie Peak

step Fly to Southshore
  when !done uld-start
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Southshore"

step Southshore
  when onquest 1052
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Ride north to Thelsamar and fly to Southshore. Raleigh the Devout preaches by the inn.
  turnin 1052                         -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs
  note Raleigh's next errand is in the Scarlet Monastery: alone, skip it; in a group, the next steps.

# Groupe Alliance 0.5.0: the Scarlet Monastery, optional (`when group 1053`, asked at Mae
# Paledust in Ironforge, previous guide). Quest ids, givers and bosses from Polestar's Forever
# data and Dungeons codex (bosses' levels: Loksey 34, Doan 37, Herod 40, Mograine and Whitemane
# 42); Past Due (96800) is new in Forever: Arcanist Doan has the book, 6,750 XP (Wowhead Forever
# quest page, 08/11/2026). Wing layout from the original game: not played on Forever yet.

step Scarlet Monastery (dungeon, optional): Raleigh's errand
  label sm-start
  when group 1053
  tip Group of 5. In the Name of the Light only comes after Down the Scarlet Path, from Brother Anton in Desolace: without it, the Library still pays for the two books.
  accept 1053 optional                -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs in the inn: four Scarlet bosses

step Magus Olvek
  when done sm-start
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip On the way north: he stands on the western edge of the Dalaran crater, by the road from Hillsbrad to Silverpine.
  accept 96800                        -- Magus Olvek: Past Due, Arcanist Doan's book

step To the Scarlet Monastery
  when done sm-start
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Ride through Silverpine Forest, then east across Tirisfal Glades: Horde land, keep clear of Brill and the guards on the roads. The monastery stands in the far north-east; the four wings are four doors in the courtyard.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  goto 82.6,33.8 "Scarlet Monastery" r 25

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): Mythology of the Titans under a window of a Library corridor
# (Warcraft Tavern, Scarlet Monastery quests, 11/11/2026). The Lost Magic of the Runemasters: an object
# for the Icy Veins Forever database (item 273169, looted from an object), a drop from Doan for
# Warcraft Tavern: both told, to check in game.
step The Library: Houndmaster Loksey and Arcanist Doan
  when done sm-start
  tip Loksey and his dogs wait in a small alcove near the start. Mythology of the Titans lies on the floor of one of the Library's corridors, under a window; once taken it comes back after a short while. Doan is the last boss: at half health he shields himself and blows up everything near him, run out and come back. The red book for Magus Olvek is on a table on the right of Doan's room (not there? Look on Doan's body: one Forever guide says he carries it); the Scarlet Key, for the Armory and Cathedral doors, in the chest behind him.
  kill 3974 quest 1053 optional       -- Houndmaster Loksey, elite 34
  collect 5536 quest 1050             -- Mythology of the Titans, on the floor of the Library
  kill 6487 optional                  -- Arcanist Doan, elite 37
  collect 273169 quest 96800          -- The Lost Magic of the Runemasters, red book on a table in Doan's room

step The Armory: Herod
  when done sm-start
  tip Herod spins with Whirlwind: everyone but the tank steps away until it ends. When he dies, a wave of trainees runs in: fight them at the door.
  kill 3975 quest 1053 optional       -- Herod, elite 40

step The Cathedral: Mograine and Whitemane
  when done sm-start
  tip Clear the chapel's pews first: pulling Mograine brings the whole room. Mograine first; when he falls, Whitemane runs in, puts the group to sleep and raises him once: kill him again, then her.
  kill 3976 quest 1053 optional       -- Scarlet Commander Mograine, elite 42
  kill 3977 quest 1053 optional       -- High Inquisitor Whitemane, elite 42

step Back to Magus Olvek
  when done sm-start
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 96800                        -- Magus Olvek

step Southshore: Raleigh the Devout
  when done sm-start
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  turnin 1053 optional                -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs in the inn
  note Mythology of the Titans goes back to Mae Paledust in Ironforge: the Hinterlands guide (Group 22) passes there.

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.8,46.8 "The Hinterlands"

step Aerie Peak
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Ride north-east out of Southshore on the road into the Hinterlands; Aerie Peak sits just past the border. Falstad holds court at the top, Gryphon Master Talonaxe tends the aviary and Fraggar Thundermantle stands by the inn.
  getfp "Aerie Peak"
  turnin 1449                         -- Falstad Wildhammer
  accept 1450
  turnin 1450                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, inside
  accept 1451
  accept 2988
  accept 2880                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle, inside
  sethome "Aerie Peak" npc 7744       -- Innkeeper Thulfram, below ground: bind your hearthstone here
  accept 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Aerie Peak

step Rhapsody Shindigger
  tip Rhapsody camps on the road east of Aerie Peak.
  turnin 1451
  accept 1452

step Witherbark villages
  tip The first two cages stand together in the Witherbark village south of Rhapsody; the third is in the next village to the east. Every Witherbark troll can drop a necklace.
  interact 144068 quest 2988          -- Third Witherbark Cage
  interact 144067 quest 2988          -- Second Witherbark Cage
  collect 9259 quest 2880             -- Troll Tribal Necklace
  interact 144066 quest 2988          -- First Witherbark Cage

step Aerie Peak
  turnin 2880                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle, inside
  accept 2881 optional                -- Fraggar keeps paying for necklaces: hand in any extras
  turnin 2988                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, beside the flight master at the top; inside
  note Talonaxe's next task waits for a later Hinterlands guide.
  accept 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Theramore

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Privateer Groy stands on the docks where the boat lands.
  turnin 623                          -- Privateer Groy
  turnin 1287                         -- Captain Garran Vimes, on the top floor
  accept 1288
  turnin 1288                         -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore, on the top floor

step Cortello's Riddle
  when onquest 625
  turnin 625                          -- Inside Bloodfen Burrow

step Theramore flight master
  only Warlock
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 67.5,51.2 "Theramore flight master"

step Ratchet
  only Human,Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet"

step Warlock: Summon Felsteed
  only Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  tip From Theramore, ride north into the Barrens to Ratchet, or fly if you know its flight path. Strahad Farsan teaches in the house by the bank.
  fly "Ratchet" only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne
  turnin 4488                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 4490
  turnin 4490
